## Reflection

Building this website was a bit of a learning curve and challenge, but I was able to use my problem solving skills to get a finished product that I am proud of. I was able to use what I learned in previous units, specifically the use of ggplot2, R markdown, overall R scripts. Although uploading to GitHub took some navigating, I was happy to have been able to quickly adapt and get everything uploaded and working properly. I also thought the cosmo design made the overall website look professional, and closer to something that I would want to show to clients or potential customers. Ultimately, I have found this course to change the way I look at data and programming, I now know it is not a far stretch to program a basic website or analyze data using a basic script, and I hope to utilize this with my small business in the near future.

